  itemName: Exposure Flare
  itemDescription: A compact emergency flare that emits an intense deterrent field,
    causing nearby hostile creatures to avoid the area for a limited time. The flare
    does not protect the user from environmental hazards and is intended primarily
    as a temporary means of creating distance from enemies.
